,"text":"I've added the attachments @Janin Canonero","timestamp":"2025-05-18T21:57:18","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-19-5-4-3","author":"Janin Canonero","text":"@Ben Lowe Here's the file for the keyword research. Please review it and let me know if you need some changes. Thanks!  https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1HinQ_NW19PIVRfUqtv5Ml3MULJbdvF8ewBXKO2mrt8g/edit?usp=sharing","timestamp":"2025-05-20T20:18:53","avatar":""}]},{"id":"task-19-5-5","title":"Research relm","status":"status-8","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-05-20","assignedTo":["f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c","a1e57188-a322-42b2-9d33-b5df08033685"],"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[{"id":"comment-19-5-5-0","author":"Ben Lowe","text":"They want to write these articles and will need suggestions for keyword to include in the headers -  As for the articles, I’ve got some jumping off points here:  Satellite Insurance: What innovators and Startups need to know History of satellite insurance, small background on industry, and then barriers to current insurance. Some good fodder here. Cyber risk in the space economy. Longer article surrounding some cyber risks you can pull from is attached. Article isn’t published and is confidential. Risks, regulations, and rewards: A guide for Space Economy innovators. Highlights regulatory developments in the US and globally that affect coverage, operations, capital planning, etc. Describes interplay between regulatory compliance, risk exposure, and financial viability in commercial space. Simple explainers. Why traditional insurance isn’t built for the space economy Critiques the limitations of conventional insurance models when applied to frontier industries like space. Discusses capacity, pricing, exclusions, and appetite misalignment — and how newer approaches can solve for them.","timestamp":"2025-05-16T00:07:56","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-19-5-5-1","author":"Ben Lowe","text":"@Janin Canonero dont miss this I've added what client said","timestamp":"2025-05-18T21:55:11","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-19-5-5-2","author":"Ben Lowe","text":"Hey Ben, The client Relm has come back to us with more work. This time they are looking for some content based around insurance for the space economy. It's very niche and there won't be many search terms. They have done some basic research, attached. What would the cost be to carry out the research? We would need this early next week. Thanks!","timestamp":"2025-05-16T00:08:45","avatar":""}]},{"id":"task-19-5-6","title":"Add Tasks to clients","status":"status-8","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-03-26","assignedTo":"f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c","worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[]},{"id":"task-19-5-7","title":"Keyword Resarch for Hammondschool","status":"status-8","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":["f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c","a1e57188-a322-42b2-9d33-b5df08033685"],"worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[{"id":"comment-19-5-7-0","author":"Janin Canonero","text":"Hammondschool.org","timestamp":"2025-05-22T23:52:04","avatar":""},{"id":"comment-19-5-7-1","author":"Ben Lowe","text":"this done ?","timestamp":"2025-05-28T10:08:55","avatar":""}]},{"id":"task-19-5-8","title":"Check all content audits","status":"status-8","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-03-25","assignedTo":"f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c","worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[]},{"id":"task-19-5-9","title":"Software cost","status":"status-8","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-03-21","assignedTo":"f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c","worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[]},{"id":"task-19-5-10","title":"Daily Serps Check","status":"status-8","priority":"","dueDate":"2025-11-20","assignedTo":"f9f11222-d2a9-4ae8-a327-8c4621d90b7c","worksheet":"","clientSheet":"","comments":[]}]}],"statusDefs":[{"id":"status-1","label":"To Do","color":"#C4C4C4"},{"id":"status-2","label":"Working on it","color":"#FDAB3D"},{"id":"status-3","label":"Review","color":"#A25DDC"},{"id":"status-4","label":"QA","color":"#9CD326"},{"id":"status-5","label":"Ben To Check","color":"#00C875"},{"id":"status-6","label":"Sent To Client","color":"#579BFC"},{"id":"status-7","label":"Revisions Required","color":"#E44258"},{"id":"status-8","label":"Done","color":"#00D084"}],"priorityDefs":[{"id":"priority-1","label":"Low","color":"#C4C4C4"},{"id":"priority-2","label":"Medium","color":"#FDAB3D"},{"id":"priority-3","label":"High","color":"#E44258"},{"id":"priority-4","label":"Critical ⚠️️","color":"#FF0000"}]}$$::jsonb);

